@host = http://localhost:5080

### 1. Happy path — inspect Server-Timing / X-Timeout-* headers
GET {{host}}/api/products/TEL-080

### 2. Optional dependency slow → 200, page degrades to "stock unknown"
GET {{host}}/api/products/TEL-080
X-Simulate-Latency: inventory=3000

### 3. Required dependency slow → 504 after catalog's 500 ms policy
GET {{host}}/api/products/TEL-080
X-Simulate-Latency: catalog=3000

### 4. Non-cooperative legacy SDK → Pessimistic strategy releases the caller at 300 ms
GET {{host}}/api/products/TEL-080
X-Simulate-Latency: tax=3000

### 5. Caller advertises a 150 ms deadline → every nested budget shrinks to fit
GET {{host}}/api/products/TEL-080
X-Request-Timeout-Ms: 150
X-Simulate-Latency: demand=2000

### 6. Downstream honours the propagated deadline on its own
GET {{host}}/api/warehouse/stock/TEL-080?latencyMs=3000
X-Request-Timeout-Ms: 100

### 7. Budget-aware loop → partial report, delivered before the deadline
GET {{host}}/api/reports/sales?days=365

### 8. Effective configuration (hot-reloads from appsettings.json)
GET {{host}}/api/timeouts

### 9. What would pricing.tax get right now? (field-level inheritance)
GET {{host}}/api/timeouts/plan/pricing.tax
